            "question": "How do I take Dermaboost+?",
            "answer": "<p>Take two (2) capsules once daily with water. For enhanced support, take two (2) capsules twice daily with water.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is in Dermaboost+?",
            "answer": "<p>Each serving (2 capsules) contains vitamin C, vitamin D (from lichen), niacin (as niacinamide), zinc, Longvida® optimized curcumin extract, quercetin, olive leaf extract and astaxanthin. The full Supplement Facts are on this page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does one bottle last?",
            "answer": "<p>One bottle lasts 30 days at the daily serving and 15 days at the enhanced serving.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where does Dermaboost+ fit in the Alchemia MD system?",
            "answer": "<p>Dermaboost+ is the Restore step: daily immune support and antioxidant nutrition for calm, balanced skin.†</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Should I check with my healthcare professional first?",
            "answer": "<p>Consult your healthcare professional before taking if you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medications or have a medical condition.</p>"
          }
        }
